<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">我们的交流一天比一天少</text><text for="L2">你似乎正对我丧失兴趣</text><text for="L3">我对你仍爱意澎湃</text><text for="L4">你对我却不再悸动如初</text><text for="L5">所以我会收拾好行囊</text><text for="L6">逃离到远方去</text><text for="L7">你那么迷人美丽</text><text for="L8">我却那么不堪</text><text for="L9">你还会再爱上我吗 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(爱上我吗)</span></text><text for="L10">没有我 你的生活照常继续</text><text for="L11">这让我有些难过</text><text for="L12">我该让自己的心伤透才行吗</text><text for="L13">你到底想要我怎样</text><text for="L14">你从未真正注意过我</text><text for="L15">所以 我只能痛苦地拉上窗帘</text><text for="L16">再为你等上几周</text><text for="L17">你那么迷人美丽</text><text for="L18">我却那么不堪</text><text for="L19">你还会再爱上我吗 <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" ttm:role="x-bg">(爱上我吗)</span></text><text for="L20">没有我 你的生活照常继续</text><text for="L21">这让我有些难过</text><text for="L22">我该让自己的心伤透才行吗</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="unhappy"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="s0rrow"/><amll:meta key="album" value="unhappy"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="002eCtZn2FfsqL"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="6790708389"/></metadata></head><body><div begin="0:16.661" end="1:22.535"><p begin="0:16.661" end="0:19.990" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:16.661" end="0:17.413">Every</span> <span begin="0:17.413" end="0:17.957">day</span> <span begin="0:17.957" end="0:18.316">we</span> <span begin="0:18.316" end="0:18.844">talk</span> <span begin="0:18.844" end="0:19.093">a</span> <span begin="0:19.093" end="0:19.589">little</span> <span begin="0:19.589" end="0:19.990">less</span></p><p begin="0:20.205" end="0:23.964" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:20.205" end="0:20.421">It</span> <span begin="0:20.421" end="0:20.860">looks</span> <span begin="0:20.860" end="0:21.374">like</span> <span begin="0:21.374" end="0:21.861">you</span> <span begin="0:21.861" end="0:22.043">are</span> <span begin="0:22.350" end="0:23.115">losing</span> <span begin="0:23.115" end="0:23.964">interest</span></p><p begin="0:24.342" end="0:26.779" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.342" end="0:24.516">These</span> <span begin="0:24.516" end="0:25.284">feelings</span> <span begin="0:25.284" end="0:25.452">I</span> <span begin="0:25.452" end="0:26.212">have</span> <span begin="0:26.212" end="0:26.475">for</span> <span begin="0:26.475" end="0:26.779">you</span></p><p begin="0:27.026" end="0:28.751" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:27.026" end="0:27.234">But</span> <span begin="0:27.234" end="0:27.482">you</span> <span begin="0:27.482" end="0:28.026">don't</span> <span begin="0:28.026" end="0:28.290">feel</span> <span begin="0:28.290" end="0:28.530">the</span> <span begin="0:28.530" end="0:28.751">same</span></p><p begin="0:29.015" end="0:30.952" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.015" end="0:29.247">So</span> <span begin="0:29.247" end="0:29.535">I'll</span> <span begin="0:29.535" end="0:30.060">pack</span> <span begin="0:30.060" end="0:30.279">all</span> <span begin="0:30.279" end="0:30.575">my</span> <span begin="0:30.575" end="0:30.952">things</span></p><p begin="0:31.119" end="0:32.857" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.119" end="0:31.351">And</span> <span begin="0:31.351" end="0:31.519">go</span> <span begin="0:31.519" end="0:32.086">run</span> <span begin="0:32.086" end="0:32.406">far</span> <span begin="0:32.406" end="0:32.857">away</sp